      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I once saw a user with stuttering IK and was fully convinced it was intentional. It made them stand out and fit the avatars anime aesthetic very well. I've always wanted to replicate the effect and thought it would be complicated using toggling constraints, but have just learned that Dynamic Bones could do this the whole time with the Update Rate setting.\nI hope this is added as I would love to achieve this effect using PhysBones. It really can add to an avatars artistic expression.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
