      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I mainly work on anime avatars. Being able to set my dynamics to a lower framerate(24fps) to get that anime aesthetic is such a nice add, little details like this really makes the avatar shine.\n \nI was disappointed to find out phys bones does not offer such feature but I understand if it wasn't in mind when developing physbones. Hopefully something like this can be added.\nI have an example using Tanjiro from Demon Slayer.\nLeft is Dynamic bones | Update rate set at 24\nRight is Physbones | Default settings\nhttps://streamable.com/unauhs",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
